{
  "id": "queue-counts-keep-going",
  "title": "Queue counts are the same with and without keep going (ADR-033)",
  "covers": [
    "queue.counts_keep_going"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "Limits: 1 new and 1 review per day. Three review cards are overdue, three cards are new.",
    "Step 0, normal queue: one review and one new card are served; counts say 1 / 0 / 1.",
    "Step 1, keep_going=true: all three reviews, then new cards, are served; counts still describe the normal queue.",
    "Step 2, normal queue again: identical to step 0 (keep going is stateless).",
    "ADR-037: loop minus phase / keep_going (ready, later_today, backlog, reviews, new) is equal in all three steps."
  ],
